Propagate cached console cursor visibility through AlphaCursor and RichCursor.
Keep shape independent of visibility, preserve define-only devices, and query
the current console on replay so hidden cursors stay hidden. Clear cursors on
consoles without a shape, including equal-sized console switches.
Build RichCursor masks from the replayed shape and convert all source pixels.
Alpha pixel ordering remains unchanged.

